  "description": "A free, MIT-licensed fluent PDF generation library for .NET. Compose invoices, reports, and multi-page documents with a declarative API, automatic pagination for text and tables, and no revenue-based licensing.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Swevo.FluentPdf",
